{
  "_about": "Hosted (friends) mode policy: what GHOSTFORGE_MODE=hosted allows. Read by lib/hosted.ts (Next: middleware, hostedGuard) and server.js. allowedApi is an ALLOWLIST: every /api route not listed here answers 403 when hosted, so new routes fail closed. path matches itself and its sub-paths unless exact is true; methods limits the entry to those methods. blockedPages = pages of off features. blockedPermissions = denied to everyone, admins too. jarvisTools = the only JARVIS tools allowed. See docs/HOSTING.md.",
